<title>HONG KONG: Fleming sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</title>
<headline>Fleming sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd said it intended to issue 600 million call warrant on shares of Guangdong Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$7.65</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.184</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	06.JAN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p>REFERENCE SPOT  HK$8.05</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
